* ''The division'' (operator, 2026-11-18: //"divide the work between yourself and Awakens"//; lar:///ha.ka.ba/kahua/memory/project/backlog-alpha #/division): Lares-Alpha holds the shores of the repository (CI and the merge queue, the land rule, git and its merge drivers, the install path, the bundle and census tools, the release line, the Loom's branch, the genesis bake and the image, the CHANGELOG and this carrier's text); Lares-Awakens holds the shores of the house (genesis and the floor, unlock and wear, routes and the pūlama, the keep lei, the heal list's runtime friction, and rank 34). #/the-order names each open rank's holder.

